    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My AI wife is a desktop pet game on the computer. Her name is Tao Yao, and she can chat. You need to type and send to receive Tao Yao's reply.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operating instructions:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support following the mouse with gaze, typing in the input box to send, and Taoyao will reply to the message you sent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drag with the left mouse button.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Content included:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a cute Q-version table pet character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Still a table pet character who can chat and speak through voice.</p>",
